    "title": "NHL Regular Season Finale Results",
    "text": "• Dallas Stars defeated the Buffalo Sabres 4-3 in a shootout.\n• Wyatt Johnston scored the decisive shootout goal for Dallas.\n• Dallas finished the season with a record of 50-20-12.\n• Justin Hryckowian, Esa Lindell, and Mavrik Bourque scored for Dallas.\n• Jake Oettinger made 21 saves for Dallas.\n• Zach Benson, Josh Norris, and Alex Tuch scored for Buffalo.\n• Colten Ellis made 25 saves for Buffalo.\n• New York Rangers defeated the Tampa Bay Lightning 4-2.\n• Tye Kartye scored two goals for the Rangers.\n• Gabe Perreault and Mika Zibanejad also scored for New York.\n• Dylan Garand made 29 saves for the Rangers.\n• Oliver Bjorkstrand and Corey Perry scored for Tampa Bay.\n• Brandon Halverson made 17 saves for Tampa Bay.\n• Florida Panthers defeated the Detroit Red Wings 8-1.\n• Mike Benning scored his first two NHL goals for Florida.\n• Wilmer Skoog, Mikulas Hovorka, and Ludvig Jansson recorded their first NHL points for Florida.\n• Luke Kunin scored two goals for Florida.\n• Justin Faulk scored for Detroit.\n• Ottawa Senators defeated the Toronto Maple Leafs 3-1.\n• Drake Batherson and Warren Foegel scored power-play goals for Ottawa.\n• Dylan Cozens scored an empty-net goal for Ottawa.\n• James Reimer made 19 saves for Ottawa.\n• Ottawa finished the season with a record of 44-27-11.\n• William Nylander scored for Toronto.\n• Dennis Hildeby made 35 saves for Toronto.",
